<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE- Tat Finance H1 net up at S$5.4 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Tat Finance H1 net up at S$5.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.39  vs  5.13</p>
<p>Group shr (cents)		    7.48  vs  7.13</p>
<p>    Operating revenue		   22.04  vs 20.68</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.15  vs  0.09</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		  10.98  vs  9.36</p>
<p>    Depreciation and amortisation    0.35  vs  0.35</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 7.42  vs  7.14</p>
<p>    Tax					2.03  vs  2.01</p>
<p>Note - Tat Lee Finance Ltd is a unit of Tat Lee Bank Ltd.</p>
